{"id":"wb-7-1460","name":"五泉山建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"五泉山建筑群","text":"五泉山建筑群位于中国甘肃省兰州市城关区五泉山公园内，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n五泉山建筑群始建于元代，明、清两代及民国年间多次增建重修。现有庄严寺古建筑群、浚源寺古建筑群、二郎庙、文昌宫古建筑群、大悲殿、武侯祠、地藏寺、卧佛殿、嘛呢寺古建筑群、酒仙祠古建筑群、千佛阁、三教洞、清虚府古建筑群、万源阁、青云梯、木牌坊、山门、半月亭、企桥、秦公庙、太昊宫古建筑群、子午亭、八卦台、澄碧滴翠水榭和漪澜亭共25组，建筑面积1万平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%94%E6%B3%89%E5%B1%B1%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":86544618,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86544618","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8ba064c990c3557ed38b0661.jpg","title":"Lanzhou_Wuquan_Shan_2013.12.29_17-05-38.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lanzhou_Wuquan_Shan_2013.12.29_17-05-38.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/Lanzhou_Wuquan_Shan_2013.12.29_17-05-38.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"兰州五泉山建筑群","width":320,"height":213}}